* ''A fresh grant unlock per ward act''. The face grant key stays sealed while custody stands unlocked; each ward-gated act unlocks it fresh from the passphrase through the minted KDF port (native scrypt on the host, noble in a worker, identical bytes), signs once and zeroes it in `finally`. The unlock runs in the vessel's worker, never on a page.

